      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KAELIX NITRO (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at The Gardens behind Fascinate Abby (23.08) in a Grade 5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Top prospect. HARD RIGHT (2) is an honest type who is new to this track. Jumped well from box two latest to win by 3.5 lengths at Richmond (18.29) and has drawn the same this time. Won at his only start from this draw. Should be in this for a long way. ZIPPING LOMBARDI (4) wasn't far away at the finish when 5th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (23.58) at The Gardens. Form from her last run is proving strong. Should be about the money. CHEVY THE BEAST (7) can find the frame without surprising.",
